{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "BenchGo 设备中心",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "本机 owner 使用 launch 一次性入口获取私有会话路径。设备 token、SSH 密码和私钥不在公开响应暴露。MCP delegation 不变，不开放 Agent 设备切换或 SSH 工具。 自有中继首版为单主机独占 HTTPS 源，TLS 在用户中继终止，中继运营者可读取内容；不增加 MCP 管理工具。"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:{port}/s/{session}",
      "variables": {
        "port": {
          "default": "0",
          "description": "运行时分配环回端口"
        },
        "session": {
          "default": "REDACTED",
          "description": "一次性入口签发的私有会话路径"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/api/devices": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "设备保存、配对、切换与服务器管理",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DeviceRequest"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "list:{devices,activeId,capabilities}; pair:{requestId,expiresAt}; pairStatus:{status,device?}; select:{device,url}; sshProbe:{fingerprint}; sshConnect/reconnect/update:{jobId}; job:{id,state,steps,device?,error?}; serverAction:{operation,status?,logs?}"
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "输入错误或操作失败"
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "身份或入口过期"
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "来源未授权"
          }
        },
        "description": "请求 Origin 必须等于设备中心源。sshProbe 不发送认证，sshConnect 必须包含用户确认的原始 SHA256 fingerprint。select 返回一次性工作台 URL。移除只删除本机连接，不卸载服务器。 Android 原生还支持 closeWorkbench 关闭本机页面；Node 由前端关闭 iframe。Android 任务终态为 completed/failed。 list.capabilities.hostAdmin 表示允许管理当前主机连接；hostStatus/hostConfigure/hostPairing/hostConfirm/hostReject/hostRevoke 为受限 owner 调用。配对 uri 接受完整 dshlink://pair 或 HTTPS /link/#code=...。SSH 任务在 TLS 指纹、设备令牌及真实 HTML 工作台验证成功后才注册设备。 relayProbe/relayDeploy/relayAction 仅支持能力 relayDeploy 的 owner 桌面设备中心；部署成功自动保存并启用主机连接，job.relay 不含密钥。hostRelayConfigure 接收 url/token/enabled，状态不回显 token。relayAction operation 为 status/logs/start/stop/restart/renew/renew-status/diagnose/uninstall；diagnose 返回脱敏诊断日志，renew-status 返回自动续期 timer 状态。已批准配对的 routes 支持 relayId、priority、health、cooldownUntil 和 lastError；连接顺序固定为直连后按中继优先级尝试，冷却节点跳过，证书异常或授权失败不降级，活动请求不重放。历史单地址配对保持兼容，重新配对获取 routes。"
      }
    },
    "/api/commander-devices": {
      "servers": [
        {
          "url": "/"
        }
      ],
      "post": {
        "summary": "官方 owner 通道：打开当前主机设备中心",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "action"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "action": {
                    "const": "launch"
                  },
                  "parentOrigin": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "additionalProperties": false
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "返回 {url}：一次性本机设备中心入口"
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "输入错误或操作失败"
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "身份或入口过期"
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "来源未授权"
          }
        },
        "description": "本机返回隔离环回入口。设备中心不会把 owner 会话或管理凭据转发给远程工作台；远程设备继续使用独立设备认证。"
      }
    },
    "/api/commander-link": {
      "servers": [
        {
          "url": "/"
        }
      ],
      "post": {
        "summary": "Owner Link 管理",
        "description": "仅官方 owner 通道。status 返回 Link 与中继状态，不返回设备令牌或中继密钥。pairing.mode 支持 relay：仅通道在线时签发中继 HTTPS 配对地址；通过 DSH_LINK_RELAY_URL/TOKEN 配置主机出站连接，密钥不在响应暴露。relay-configure 为 owner 显式保存 url/token/enabled，优先于启动环境变量；token 仅写入 0600 配置，状态返回 relay:{configured,enabled,url,connected,lastError}，不回显 token。部署与中继管理不新增 MCP。",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "oneOf": [
                  {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": [
                      "action"
                    ],
                    "properties": {
                      "action": {
                        "enum": [
                          "status",
                          "configure",
                          "pairing",
                          "confirm",
                          "reject",
                          "revoke",
                          "relay-configure",
                          "relay-pool-configure"
                        ]
                      },
                      "url": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "token": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "writeOnly": true
                      },
                      "enabled": {
                        "type": "boolean"
                      },
                      "host": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "port": {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "minimum": 0,
                        "maximum": 65535
                      },
                      "publicUrl": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "mode": {
                        "enum": [
                          "lan",
                          "public",
                          "relay"
                        ]
                      },
                      "address": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "id": {
                        "type": "string"
                      }
                    },
                    "additionalProperties": false
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "当前 Link 与中继状态"
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "输入无效、配置错误或服务关闭"
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "需要 owner 身份"
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "owner 权限或来源无效"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "DeviceRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "action"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "action": {
            "enum": [
              "list",
              "pair",
              "pairStatus",
              "select",
              "rename",
              "remove",
              "sshProbe",
              "sshConnect",
              "job",
              "reconnect",
              "serverAction",
              "hostStatus",
              "hostConfigure",
              "hostPairing",
              "hostConfirm",
              "hostReject",
              "hostRevoke",
              "relayProbe",
              "relayDeploy",
              "relayAction",
              "hostRelayConfigure",
              "hostRelayPoolConfigure"
            ]
          },
          "deviceId": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "jobId": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "requestId": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "uri": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri"
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 100
          },
          "host": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "port": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 65535,
            "default": 22,
            "description": "SSH 为 1–65535（默认22）；hostConfigure 为 0–65535，0分配随机端口。"
          },
          "username": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "fingerprint": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "password": {
            "type": "string",
            "writeOnly": true
          },
          "privateKey": {
            "type": "string",
            "writeOnly": true
          },
          "passphrase": {
            "type": "string",
            "writeOnly": true
          },
          "source": {
            "enum": [
              "mirror",
              "github"
            ],
            "default": "mirror"
          },
          "operation": {
            "enum": [
              "status",
              "start",
              "stop",
              "restart",
              "logs",
              "renew",
              "renew-status",
              "diagnose",
              "uninstall",
              "update",
              "enable",
              "rotate",
              "disable"
            ]
          },
          "enabled": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "publicUrl": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "mode": {
            "enum": [
              "lan",
              "public",
              "relay"
            ]
          },
          "address": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "id": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "key": {
            "type": "string",
            "writeOnly": true,
            "minLength": 16,
            "maxLength": 512
          },
          "publicIp": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "服务器公网 IP；无需域名"
          },
          "email": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "relayPort": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 20000,
            "maximum": 49151
          },
          "challengeMode": {
            "enum": [
              "standalone",
              "webroot"
            ]
          },
          "webroot": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "url": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri"
          },
          "token": {
            "type": "string",
            "writeOnly": true
          },
          "nodes": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 8,
            "description": "中继池有序节点；token 仅写入，不在响应返回。",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "id",
                "url"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "id": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "maxLength": 128
                },
                "url": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "format": "uri"
                },
                "token": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "writeOnly": true
                },
                "priority": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 0
                },
                "enabled": {
                  "type": "boolean"
                }
              },
              "additionalProperties": false
            }
          }
        },
        "allOf": [
          {
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "action": {
                  "enum": [
                    "sshProbe",
                    "sshConnect"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            "then": {
              "properties": {
                "port": {
                  "minimum": 1
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "Device": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "id",
          "name",
          "kind",
          "status"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "kind": {
            "enum": [
              "local",
              "computer",
              "ssh"
            ]
          },
          "url": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "status": {
            "enum": [
              "unknown",
              "online",
              "offline"
            ]
          },
          "lastError": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "warning": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "Job": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "state": {
            "enum": [
              "running",
              "done",
              "error"
            ]
          },
          "steps": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "name": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "state": {
                  "enum": [
                    "running",
                    "done",
                    "error"
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "device": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Device"
          },
          "error": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
